>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `algebra_ss`

``` hol4
seedCollections.algebra_ss : unit -> simpLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Returns an ssfrag containing the ancestry-backed `algebra_simps` collection.
The collection is opt-in and is not installed in `srw_ss()`.

### Example

``` hol4
SIMP_TAC (srw_ss() ++ seedCollections.algebra_ss ()) []
```

### See also

[`seedCollections.field_ss`](#seedCollections.field_ss),
[`seedCollections.remove_algebra_simps`](#seedCollections.remove_algebra_simps)
